CPU and Memory Resource Limiting:-
BEGIN
    INPUT application_list

    FOR each app IN application_list DO
        CREATE cgroup for app

        SET CPU limit for app
        SET memory limit for app

        ASSIGN app process to cgroup
    ENDFOR

    PRINT "Resource limits applied successfully"
END

Purpose: Uses control groups (cgroups) to restrict CPU and memory consumption, preventing one application from consuming excessive system resources and improving overall system stability.




